<http://data.silknow.org/object/4293f041-40c3-367e-ab1a-850641e91eee>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Pair of sash borders of embroidered silk with silk and metal threads. With filling stitch is double darning on the diagonal, and other stitches of double running in a line, fishbone and needle-weaving. The metal thread embroidery is worked in fishbone stitch and double running in a line. Plate has been used to work in satin stitch and Tel Kirman (Turkish Plate Stitch) in isolated knots.\n\nWith a design of flower sprays and leaves. The spray on the left has a central stem with a single scrolled end from which spring smaller stems. The spray on the right consists of three stems joined at the bottom to a single stem with two scrolled ends. Underneath each spray is a small band of needle-weaving."@en , "Pair of sash borders of embroidered silk with silk and metal threads, Turkey, 19th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/1d68d075-742b-3e52-aff6-5dc43915f8ea> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/9f370f7b-5dd1-3dfe-9a21-b32f6df7b0ee> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Pair of sash borders of embroidered silk with silk and metal threads. With filling stitch is double darning on the diagonal, and other stitches of double running in a line, fishbone and needle-weaving. The metal thread embroidery is worked in fishbone stitch and double running in a line. Plate has been used to work in satin stitch and Tel Kirman (Turkish Plate Stitch) in isolated knots.\n\nWith a design of flower sprays and leaves. The spray on the left has a central stem with a single scrolled end from which spring smaller stems. The spray on the right consists of three stems joined at the bottom to a single stem with two scrolled ends. Underneath each spray is a small band of needle-weaving."@en , "Pair of sash borders of embroidered silk with silk and metal threads, Turkey, 19th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/4293f041-40c3-367e-ab1a-850641e91eee/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/4293f041-40c3-367e-ab1a-850641e91eee/dimension/1> ;
